---
description: Hard rules — never violated
alwaysApply: true
---
Never use raw <img> tags — use <NuxtImg> with explicit width, height, loading, format.
In Storyblok mode (when .storyblok/ exists), never hardcode copy in Vue components — copy comes from Storyblok blocks. In static mode, hardcoded copy in components is acceptable or use a content/ directory.
Never edit the Storyblok schema via the UI — edit .storyblok/components/ and sync.
Never run git commands — the developer handles all version control.
Never deploy — the developer handles deployment.
Never ask the user follow-up questions — infer from the brief, apply defaults, log assumptions in agent-changes.md.
